1
00:01:38,070 --> 00:01:43,050
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,110 --> 00:01:43,690
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,690 --> 00:01:45,940
[Episode 11]

4
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,710
[Ferry]

5
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:56,700
Excuse me, sir.

6
00:01:57,789 --> 00:01:58,680
Are there any ships heading to

7
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:00,280
Mingling County, Qingzhou?

8
00:02:00,590 --> 00:02:01,590
Heading south?

9
00:02:01,870 --> 00:02:03,310
See the ship with the "Gong" flag?

10
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:04,510
It came from Qingzhou.

11
00:02:04,510 --> 00:02:05,430
Go ask them.

12
00:02:05,590 --> 00:02:06,400
Thank you.

13
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,120
There's a ship?

14
00:02:13,870 --> 00:02:14,840
Be careful.

15
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:16,800
Freeze.

16
00:02:17,590 --> 00:02:18,520
Zhenzhu?

17
00:02:20,590 --> 00:02:21,400
Meng Rui?

18
00:02:21,710 --> 00:02:23,120
What brings you here?

19
00:02:23,310 --> 00:02:25,079
Yan, what a coincidence.

20
00:02:25,180 --> 00:02:26,280
Aren't you on leave?

21
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,210
Why are you here?

22
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:30,120
I am on leave.

23
00:02:30,190 --> 00:02:31,280
I'm just about to take a ship

24
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,630
to travel south.

25
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:34,130
South?

26
00:02:34,710 --> 00:02:35,970
Is it Mingling County?

27
00:02:37,870 --> 00:02:38,680
Come on.

28
00:02:39,079 --> 00:02:40,680
We all know what's going on.

29
00:02:40,710 --> 00:02:41,870
How could I not know

30
00:02:41,910 --> 00:02:43,120
what is on your mind?

31
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,060
You Little Ice Cube.

32
00:02:45,190 --> 00:02:46,870
You can fool the Chief,

33
00:02:46,910 --> 00:02:48,470
but you can't fool me.

34
00:02:48,910 --> 00:02:51,310
Resting and feeling homesick?

35
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:52,520
No one would believe these words

36
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:53,280
coming from

37
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,400
a Constable Ghost's mouth.

38
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:55,329
Right, Zhenzhu?

39
00:02:57,079 --> 00:02:58,310
I figure

40
00:02:58,310 --> 00:02:59,400
Mingling County

41
00:02:59,420 --> 00:03:01,270
must have a

42
00:03:01,590 --> 00:03:02,910
huge case.

43
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:05,410
You want to go there without me?

44
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,590
No way!

45
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:08,910
This is what it means

46
00:03:08,910 --> 00:03:10,910
to face dangers together—

47
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,560
And solve cases together.

48
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:15,310
Let's go. I've asked about the ship.

49
00:03:16,610 --> 00:03:18,000
[Ferry]

50
00:03:16,710 --> 00:03:18,570
This trip is of great importance.

51
00:03:18,630 --> 00:03:19,630
Tell the brothers

52
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,030
to stay alert.

53
00:03:21,630 --> 00:03:23,560
Excuse me, is there a boatman here?

54
00:03:25,190 --> 00:03:26,190
Are you the owner?

55
00:03:26,370 --> 00:03:27,540
Officer,

56
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,310
you can't just say that.

57
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:30,240
Who doesn't know

58
00:03:30,550 --> 00:03:31,829
that on the sea,

59
00:03:31,850 --> 00:03:33,150
all the Gong family's ships

60
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:34,900
belong to Old Madam Gong?

61
00:03:34,930 --> 00:03:36,980
I am Shama Reda.

62
00:03:37,370 --> 00:03:38,760
I am just a manager

63
00:03:38,790 --> 00:03:40,310
in charge of chores.

64
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:41,610
The Gong family?

65
00:03:41,910 --> 00:03:44,120
The Gong family of Mingling County,
Qingzhou?

66
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,079
On the sea,

67
00:03:45,630 --> 00:03:47,290
there is only one Gong family.

68
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:49,870
What a boast.

69
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,280
He's not wrong.

70
00:03:52,430 --> 00:03:53,890
Among civilian shipping,

71
00:03:54,030 --> 00:03:56,240
the Gong family
was appointed by His Majesty

72
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,750
for official transport.

73
00:03:58,590 --> 00:03:59,910
No matter whose ship this is,

74
00:03:59,910 --> 00:04:00,710
are you

75
00:04:00,710 --> 00:04:02,800
going to Mingling County, Qingzhou?

76
00:04:02,870 --> 00:04:04,000
We are about to go back there.

77
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:04,800
Great.

78
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:05,870
Let's go.

79
00:04:05,820 --> 00:04:07,200
[Ferry]

80
00:04:06,870 --> 00:04:07,680
Officer,

81
00:04:07,810 --> 00:04:08,940
I'm terribly sorry.

82
00:04:09,310 --> 00:04:11,240
This ship doesn't take outsiders.

83
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,710
You should find another ship.

84
00:04:13,710 --> 00:04:14,630
Why?

85
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,880
It's not like we won't pay you.

86
00:04:16,930 --> 00:04:18,779
Who wouldn't want money?

87
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,310
But this ship

88
00:04:20,310 --> 00:04:21,430
has already been chartered

89
00:04:21,430 --> 00:04:22,390
by another official.

90
00:04:22,390 --> 00:04:23,190
Official?

91
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:30,970
Qingyang?

92
00:04:31,430 --> 00:04:32,700
As the saying goes,

93
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,870
"Meet a kindred soul aboard a boat,

94
00:04:34,870 --> 00:04:36,600
and entrust your life
to the boundless sea."

95
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:38,800
A God of Wealth insists on following us,

96
00:04:39,430 --> 00:04:40,800
which is exactly what we want.

97
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:42,130
What are we waiting for?

98
00:04:42,430 --> 00:04:43,480
Get on board.

99
00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:46,000
♪ I open the door to winds of change ♪

100
00:04:43,870 --> 00:04:44,680
Let's go.

101
00:04:46,070 --> 00:04:47,270
You brat.

102
00:04:47,340 --> 00:04:50,080
♪ With no desire to gaze at the stars ♪

103
00:04:51,380 --> 00:04:54,070
♪ Dreams may soothe the pain ♪

104
00:04:55,220 --> 00:04:58,150
♪ But they're too easily disturbed ♪

105
00:04:58,659 --> 00:05:00,790
♪ So I'll stand up high on a tower ♪

106
00:05:01,290 --> 00:05:03,130
♪ Never looking away ♪

107
00:05:03,620 --> 00:05:05,170
♪ And see how so-called fate ♪

108
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,270
Great.

109
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:07,350
♪ Makes choices for me ♪

110
00:05:06,870 --> 00:05:07,600
The reward

111
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:09,160
will have to be divided
into one more share.

112
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:09,380
♪ Let the breathtaking ♪

113
00:05:09,190 --> 00:05:10,000
Sanhuo.

114
00:05:09,820 --> 00:05:11,310
♪ Take the place of cold, lonely stars ♪

115
00:05:10,430 --> 00:05:11,270
Don't worry.

116
00:05:11,690 --> 00:05:13,230
♪ Cutting through the mist ♪

117
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:12,600
This time,

118
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:14,120
I sneaked out.

119
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:15,860
♪ To light up my eyes ♪

120
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,310
I'll be lucky enough if the Chief

121
00:05:15,310 --> 00:05:16,310
doesn't punish me when I get back.

122
00:05:16,030 --> 00:05:18,660
♪ If the moonlight is hidden
and the candles burn out ♪

123
00:05:16,510 --> 00:05:17,310
How could I

124
00:05:17,830 --> 00:05:19,430
take a share of the reward?

125
00:05:19,330 --> 00:05:21,030
♪ And I can't see myself ♪

126
00:05:24,100 --> 00:05:26,710
♪ I believe
some unseen longing surges within ♪

127
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:29,070
♪ Pulling me along ♪

128
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:30,160
Come on.

129
00:05:30,950 --> 00:05:31,680
Why do you guys

130
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,120
look so lifeless?

131
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:35,310
This is the first time
our Four Divine Constables

132
00:05:35,310 --> 00:05:36,600
have gathered together

133
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,930
for official business.

134
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,190
Don't you think

135
00:05:39,870 --> 00:05:41,530
even the scenery along the way

136
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:42,560
has become more

137
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,680
charming?

138
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:47,650
♪ After all the twists and turns,
through a thousand joys and sorrows ♪

139
00:05:48,159 --> 00:05:51,820
♪ I only hope tomorrow finds me
still full of courage ♪

140
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,659
♪ At daybreak, I'll look back ♪

141
00:05:55,420 --> 00:05:59,970
♪ And finally understand
why this journey had to be mine ♪

142
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:24,620
[Mingling Serial Corpse Case]

143
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:35,920
Look there.

144
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:37,580
There are fish.

145
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:44,610
Come and look! We're almost there!

146
00:06:44,690 --> 00:06:51,870
[Mingling County, Coastal Qingzhou,
Great Shi, Early Summer]

147
00:06:52,340 --> 00:06:54,710
[Mingling County]

148
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:53,720
Hold it!

149
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:54,360
Okay.

150
00:06:55,630 --> 00:06:56,240
Careful.

151
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:57,720
Be quick!

152
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,040
Hurry up and bring the ladder over!

153
00:06:59,040 --> 00:06:59,720
Hurry!

154
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:00,430
Over there!

155
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:02,600
The weather in the south

156
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,920
is indeed different.

157
00:07:04,090 --> 00:07:05,240
It's just the beginning of summer,

158
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,570
and it's already so hot.

159
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:09,870
Mr. Reda,

160
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,640
what are those people doing?

161
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:15,680
They are rushing to dig a flood channel

162
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:17,140
so that if it rains heavily later,

163
00:07:17,140 --> 00:07:18,950
the whole county won't be flooded.

164
00:07:18,950 --> 00:07:19,750
What?

165
00:07:19,870 --> 00:07:20,800
Heavy rain?

166
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:23,810
Who are you kidding?

167
00:07:24,190 --> 00:07:25,430
It's so sunny.

168
00:07:25,430 --> 00:07:27,040
We're almost dried out.

169
00:07:27,190 --> 00:07:28,510
How could there be heavy rain?

170
00:07:28,510 --> 00:07:29,480
Well,

171
00:07:29,630 --> 00:07:30,940
you have no idea.

172
00:07:31,310 --> 00:07:32,630
Our Mingling County

173
00:07:32,870 --> 00:07:34,390
is backed by Mount Fuyao

174
00:07:34,510 --> 00:07:35,680
and faces the sea,

175
00:07:35,870 --> 00:07:37,870
with the Yan River
flowing through the mountains.

176
00:07:37,870 --> 00:07:40,430
The weather and terrain

177
00:07:40,510 --> 00:07:42,370
can be different every few miles.

178
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:44,120
One moment it's sunny,

179
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:46,430
and the next it's pouring rain.

180
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,510
It's the rainy season now.

181
00:07:48,630 --> 00:07:49,510
It rains

182
00:07:49,510 --> 00:07:50,600
every few days.

183
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,040
A little carelessness

184
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,800
will cause floods

185
00:07:55,070 --> 00:07:56,310
and trigger a plague.

186
00:07:56,390 --> 00:07:57,190
So,

187
00:07:57,310 --> 00:07:58,570
we can't be negligent.

188
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,390
Thank you. Thank you.

189
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,210
Let's go.

190
00:08:23,070 --> 00:08:23,870
Careful.

191
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,240
Come on, put some effort into it.

192
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,070
Excuse me.

193
00:08:27,070 --> 00:08:27,430
Watch out.

194
00:08:27,430 --> 00:08:28,070
Be careful.

195
00:08:28,070 --> 00:08:29,310
Good job, everyone!

196
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:31,350
[Situ Bo, Magistrate of Mingling County]

197
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,030
Put some more effort into it!

198
00:08:32,030 --> 00:08:32,840
Okay!

199
00:08:32,860 --> 00:08:33,650
Okay!

200
00:08:34,909 --> 00:08:35,720
My Lord.

201
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,260
People from Tianhuang City are here.

202
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:45,900
I'm Situ Bo,
magistrate of Mingling County.

203
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:49,320
Greetings, Divine Constables.

204
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:51,030
You are Situ Bo?

205
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:52,440
Yes, I am.

206
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,510
Divine Constables,

207
00:08:53,510 --> 00:08:55,240
you arrived in Mingling County
so suddenly.

208
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:57,080
I didn't have time to change into
my official uniform.

209
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:58,030
Please forgive

210
00:08:58,030 --> 00:08:59,090
my lack of manners.

211
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:02,200
May I ask what brings you here?

212
00:09:02,270 --> 00:09:03,080
Of course,

213
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,870
it's for the case you reported.

214
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,440
It says that

215
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,600
a green-haired demon suddenly appeared

216
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,870
in Mingling County.

217
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:11,460
We're here
specifically to catch the demon.

218
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:13,720
The story of the green-haired demon

219
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:14,630
has been spreading by word of mouth

220
00:09:14,630 --> 00:09:15,720
among the locals.

221
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,180
It's mostly exaggerated.

222
00:09:17,630 --> 00:09:19,320
But I was afraid it might hurt people,

223
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,630
so I led my men in searching for it
many times,

224
00:09:20,630 --> 00:09:21,990
but we found no trace of it.

225
00:09:21,990 --> 00:09:23,870
Reporting it
to the Divine Constable Bureau

226
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:25,240
was a last resort.

227
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:27,120
My Lord!

228
00:09:27,510 --> 00:09:28,320
Bad news!

229
00:09:29,270 --> 00:09:30,000
Bad news, My Lord.

230
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:30,910
A corpse was found

231
00:09:30,910 --> 00:09:32,430
in Yan River in Mount Fuyao.

232
00:09:32,430 --> 00:09:33,360
My Lord, please go and take a look.

233
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,120
Lead the way.

234
00:09:34,270 --> 00:09:35,120
Okay.

235
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:40,910
Let's go.

236
00:09:55,980 --> 00:09:57,480
Luckily, it was found

237
00:09:57,510 --> 00:09:58,110
before the heavy rain.

238
00:09:58,110 --> 00:09:59,030
Otherwise, it would have been

239
00:09:59,030 --> 00:10:00,120
washed into the sea by now.

240
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,670
Mingling is really like you said.

241
00:10:01,670 --> 00:10:02,670
The rain comes fast

242
00:10:02,670 --> 00:10:03,510
and goes fast.

243
00:10:03,530 --> 00:10:05,260
The weather in Mingling is just like this.

244
00:10:05,260 --> 00:10:06,120
-Everyone here…
-Yan.

245
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:08,180
has some ability to read the weather.

246
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,360
It's been soaked like this.

247
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,890
We can't even tell who it is.

248
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,200
Where is Meng Rui?

249
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:30,130
He went upstream to look for clues.

250
00:10:30,510 --> 00:10:31,840
If the killer left any

251
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:32,910
traces,

252
00:10:32,910 --> 00:10:33,630
I think

253
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:35,800
he will definitely notice them.

254
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,030
How is it?

255
00:10:40,790 --> 00:10:42,320
The cause of death was not drowning.

256
00:10:42,320 --> 00:10:43,150
In his mouth and nose,

257
00:10:43,150 --> 00:10:44,350
there is no river mud.

258
00:10:44,510 --> 00:10:46,870
He obviously died
before he was thrown into the river.

259
00:10:46,870 --> 00:10:49,200
The fatal wound should be here.

260
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:50,520
A ruptured windpipe.

261
00:10:52,240 --> 00:10:53,120
This wound...

262
00:10:53,390 --> 00:10:54,720
The edges are turned outward,

263
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,640
so it wasn't caused by a sharp weapon.

264
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:58,320
I've seen this kind of wound before.

265
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,340
It should be...

266
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,720
caused by a beast's bite.

267
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,520
Could it be...

268
00:11:02,740 --> 00:11:04,910
that he was bitten to death
by wolves in the mountain?

269
00:11:04,910 --> 00:11:05,950
Normally,

270
00:11:06,390 --> 00:11:08,200
when wild beasts actively attack humans,

271
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:09,840
it's always for food.

272
00:11:10,660 --> 00:11:12,850
But this body is so intact

273
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:14,390
and hasn't been eaten.

274
00:11:14,830 --> 00:11:15,640
So,

275
00:11:16,670 --> 00:11:17,510
I think

276
00:11:18,410 --> 00:11:19,910
there must be something fishy about it.

277
00:11:19,910 --> 00:11:20,720
My Lord,

278
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,270
nothing like this

279
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,200
has ever happened

280
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,400
in our county before.

281
00:11:24,520 --> 00:11:25,350
Could it be

282
00:11:25,790 --> 00:11:27,320
done by that green-haired demon?

283
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:28,670
According to those who have seen it,

284
00:11:28,670 --> 00:11:30,510
that demon
has long fangs and a green face,

285
00:11:30,510 --> 00:11:32,430
with a bloody mouth like a wolf's.

286
00:11:32,460 --> 00:11:33,480
Nonsense.

287
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:36,260
Handling cases requires solid evidence.

288
00:11:36,260 --> 00:11:37,120
Especially in front of

289
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,450
the Divine Constables.

290
00:11:39,030 --> 00:11:39,840
Yes.

291
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,320
Take the body to the county office first.

292
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:43,510
It needs to be examined carefully.

293
00:11:43,510 --> 00:11:44,030
Right.

294
00:11:44,030 --> 00:11:44,670
Also,

295
00:11:44,670 --> 00:11:46,120
we must find out where the body
came from as soon as possible

296
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:47,180
and confirm his identity.

297
00:11:47,180 --> 00:11:47,820
Yes.

298
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:48,600
Take it away.

299
00:11:48,670 --> 00:11:49,440
Yes.

300
00:12:18,590 --> 00:12:20,720
This is the hinterland of Mount Fuyao,

301
00:12:20,910 --> 00:12:21,970
called Ghost Gate.

302
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:23,050
Up there are some

303
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:25,620
hanging coffins
that are over 1,000 years old.

304
00:12:25,620 --> 00:12:27,320
No wonder it's called Ghost Gate.

305
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,120
Actually,

306
00:12:28,390 --> 00:12:29,510
it's not just because of

307
00:12:29,510 --> 00:12:31,120
these hanging coffins
that it got its name.

308
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:33,480
It's really because
no one dares to come here.

309
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:34,320
Lord Situ.

310
00:12:34,750 --> 00:12:35,620
Right now,

311
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:38,080
the green-haired demon in Mingling
hasn't been eliminated.

312
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:38,910
And it seems

313
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,550
there's been a murder.

314
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:43,400
I hope you can find out the truth.

315
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:45,840
In this mountain,

316
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,720
does anyone keep dogs?

317
00:12:50,920 --> 00:12:51,870
My Lord,

318
00:12:52,910 --> 00:12:54,790
some hunters used to keep them before.

319
00:12:54,790 --> 00:12:55,510
But in the past two years,

320
00:12:55,510 --> 00:12:56,640
we haven't seen any.

321
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:58,080
Why?

322
00:12:58,480 --> 00:12:59,870
They were all taken by the Ji family

323
00:12:59,870 --> 00:13:01,390
and kept in the county town.

324
00:13:01,390 --> 00:13:02,670
Ji Ada loves dogs.

325
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:03,910
Whenever he sees a good dog,

326
00:13:03,910 --> 00:13:05,270
he buys it.

327
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:08,510
There are 2 prominent families
in Mingling.

328
00:13:08,510 --> 00:13:10,510
One is the Gong family,
a major shipping family,

329
00:13:10,510 --> 00:13:11,270
and the other

330
00:13:11,270 --> 00:13:13,080
is the Ji family, which runs rice shops.

331
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:14,720
The Ji family supplies grain

332
00:13:14,870 --> 00:13:16,470
to all the surrounding counties.

333
00:13:16,470 --> 00:13:17,680
Their business is huge.

334
00:13:17,680 --> 00:13:18,760
The two Ji brothers,

335
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:19,920
Ji Ada and Ji Er,

336
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:21,320
have quite a background.

337
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:23,270
The current Princess Ding

338
00:13:23,290 --> 00:13:24,740
is their cousin.

339
00:13:25,510 --> 00:13:26,510
I didn't expect

340
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:28,270
this little Mingling

341
00:13:28,910 --> 00:13:31,120
to have so many big shots.

342
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:33,940
Divine Constable,

343
00:13:34,270 --> 00:13:35,500
you suspect that the man

344
00:13:35,500 --> 00:13:37,030
was bitten to death by a dog?

345
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:38,760
If someone really

346
00:13:38,790 --> 00:13:39,870
did it on purpose,

347
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,390
then using a dog

348
00:13:41,500 --> 00:13:42,790
to hurt people

349
00:13:43,630 --> 00:13:45,000
is a possibility.

350
00:13:46,630 --> 00:13:47,440
However,

351
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:49,350
all of this

352
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:51,240
is just a guess for now.

353
00:13:51,910 --> 00:13:52,910
It reminds me of something.

354
00:13:52,910 --> 00:13:54,030
Speaking of dogs in the mountains,

355
00:13:54,030 --> 00:13:55,270
Ji Ada not only loves dogs,

356
00:13:55,270 --> 00:13:56,730
but he also likes hunting.

357
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:01,510
It seems

358
00:14:01,530 --> 00:14:02,550
we need to pay a visit

359
00:14:02,550 --> 00:14:03,720
to this Ji Ada.

360
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:07,270
We need to investigate Ji Ada

361
00:14:07,270 --> 00:14:09,270
and the green-haired demon.

362
00:14:10,750 --> 00:14:11,820
Lord Situ,

363
00:14:11,910 --> 00:14:13,650
the case report says

364
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:14,870
that the green-haired demon

365
00:14:14,870 --> 00:14:17,000
likes to dig up graves and eat carrion.

366
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:20,080
Where is that graveyard?

367
00:14:21,330 --> 00:14:23,050
At the northwest foot of Mount Fuyao,

368
00:14:23,050 --> 00:14:24,560
there is a mass grave.

369
00:14:24,710 --> 00:14:25,720
People have seen

370
00:14:25,720 --> 00:14:28,250
the green-haired demon there
more than once.

371
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:35,130
Divine Constables,

372
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,320
it's just ahead.

373
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:45,240
Everyone.

374
00:14:46,550 --> 00:14:47,360
Meng Rui?

375
00:14:47,440 --> 00:14:48,240
Meng.

376
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,030
Meng Rui?

377
00:14:50,270 --> 00:14:51,960
You managed to find this place?

378
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:52,670
How was it?

379
00:14:53,150 --> 00:14:54,480
Any clues from searching the mountain?

380
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,320
The traces have all been

381
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,650
washed away by the rain.

382
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:57,770
I found nothing.

383
00:15:04,870 --> 00:15:05,910
How about this?

384
00:15:06,720 --> 00:15:08,110
Zhenzhu, Yan,

385
00:15:08,550 --> 00:15:09,510
you go back

386
00:15:09,550 --> 00:15:11,080
and continue investigating the Ji family.

387
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,080
Meng Rui and I

388
00:15:12,630 --> 00:15:13,440
will go

389
00:15:13,530 --> 00:15:16,060
look for clues
about the green-haired demon.

390
00:15:19,150 --> 00:15:20,120
Chiying bugs.

391
00:15:23,550 --> 00:15:24,360
Alright.

392
00:15:26,510 --> 00:15:27,320
Sanhuo,

393
00:15:27,670 --> 00:15:29,840
I'll leave Zhenzhu in your care.

394
00:15:30,510 --> 00:15:31,320
Don't worry.

395
00:15:32,470 --> 00:15:33,670
If you find any

396
00:15:33,670 --> 00:15:34,750
clues about the green-haired demon later,

397
00:15:34,750 --> 00:15:35,750
you must tell me.

398
00:15:36,960 --> 00:15:37,750
Don't worry.

399
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,150
Be careful.

400
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:40,570
Lord Situ, let's go.

401
00:15:44,670 --> 00:15:45,480
They must be hiding something from us.

402
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:46,150
Let's go.

403
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:47,000
Let's go.

404
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:10,030
Huang Mazi,

405
00:16:10,050 --> 00:16:11,600
you fought dirty!

406
00:16:11,790 --> 00:16:13,080
Go! Get our men!

407
00:16:13,340 --> 00:16:13,910
Yes!

408
00:16:13,940 --> 00:16:15,200
Today, I'm going to fight the Ji family

409
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:16,760
to the death!

410
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:17,750
Wu Hai,

411
00:16:17,750 --> 00:16:18,870
I'm telling you!

412
00:16:18,870 --> 00:16:20,440
Even if a Gong comes here today,

413
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:22,360
our Master can crush him

414
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:23,750
with just one finger!

415
00:16:23,750 --> 00:16:24,550
Say that again!

416
00:16:24,550 --> 00:16:25,750
What?

417
00:16:25,920 --> 00:16:27,010
Say that again!

418
00:16:27,030 --> 00:16:28,360
What are you going to do about it?

419
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:28,960
What are you going to do about it?

420
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:30,510
-The Ji family and the Gong family are fighting again!
-What's the hurry?

421
00:16:30,510 --> 00:16:32,120
-It's not even your business.
-Someone almost died!

422
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,280
Bro.

423
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:35,110
Are you saying

424
00:16:35,150 --> 00:16:36,510
the Ji family that runs the rice shops

425
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:37,860
is fighting the Gong family?

426
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:39,220
What else could it be?

427
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:40,390
I heard Ji Ada

428
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:41,630
is going to duel Gong Sihai!

429
00:16:41,630 --> 00:16:42,750
Go and watch!

430
00:16:43,120 --> 00:16:45,180
-You'll miss it if you're late!
-Bye!

431
00:16:46,550 --> 00:16:47,510
Looks like

432
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:49,770
there really can't be two tigers
on one mountain.

433
00:16:49,770 --> 00:16:51,840
I think it's just a small pond
with big egos.

434
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:53,150
He'll be here soon! Just you wait!

435
00:16:53,150 --> 00:16:53,790
Just you wait!

436
00:16:53,790 --> 00:16:55,200
I'll beat you to death today!

437
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:56,270
I'm telling you!

438
00:16:56,270 --> 00:16:57,240
Don't you even know

439
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:58,240
who our Master is?

440
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:59,750
Messing with the Ji family

441
00:16:59,750 --> 00:17:01,960
means messing with
the Great Shi royal family!

442
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:03,440
It means messing with the one

443
00:17:03,440 --> 00:17:04,160
on the throne!

444
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:04,880
Exactly!

445
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:05,349
Yeah!

446
00:17:05,349 --> 00:17:07,480
That's between the Gong and Ji families!

447
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:08,839
Who do you think you are?

448
00:17:09,069 --> 00:17:10,030
No matter how loud you bark,

449
00:17:10,030 --> 00:17:12,480
you're just a dog of the Ji family!

450
00:17:12,550 --> 00:17:13,480
That's right, a dog!

451
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:14,510
Say that again!

452
00:17:14,510 --> 00:17:15,160
A dog!

453
00:17:15,310 --> 00:17:16,270
Say it again!

454
00:17:16,270 --> 00:17:17,349
Dog! Dog! Dog!

455
00:17:17,349 --> 00:17:18,589
-I'll kill you!
-Dog!

456
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:19,900
What's all this noise?

457
00:17:20,310 --> 00:17:21,339
Master Ji is here.

458
00:17:22,190 --> 00:17:23,130
Master!

459
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:24,319
You're finally here!

460
00:17:24,319 --> 00:17:25,619
Look what he did to me!

461
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:27,130
Stand up for me, Master!

462
00:17:27,160 --> 00:17:28,510
Why are you fighting?

463
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:29,550
Just you wait!

464
00:17:33,570 --> 00:17:37,300
[Ji Ada, Owner of Ji's Rice Shop]

465
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:36,510
A few people getting hurt or killed
is no big deal,

466
00:17:36,510 --> 00:17:37,440
but what about

467
00:17:37,850 --> 00:17:39,660
your Master Gong's

468
00:17:39,750 --> 00:17:40,830
reputation?

469
00:17:41,550 --> 00:17:42,350
Mr. Ji,

470
00:17:43,030 --> 00:17:44,070
stop being

471
00:17:44,070 --> 00:17:45,270
so sarcastic here!

472
00:17:45,750 --> 00:17:46,720
You were the ones

473
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:48,310
who broke the rules on the dock first.

474
00:17:48,310 --> 00:17:49,720
How could you

475
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:51,400
keep delaying payment

476
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:52,960
for using our ships?

477
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:53,750
You should see

478
00:17:53,750 --> 00:17:54,640
how much rice you confiscated from us!

479
00:17:54,640 --> 00:17:56,160
A debt must be repaid.

480
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:58,030
That's only fair.

481
00:17:58,270 --> 00:17:59,350
Besides,

482
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:01,030
it's just a few bags of rice.

483
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,070
Did you really

484
00:18:02,090 --> 00:18:03,470
have to go this far?

485
00:18:04,310 --> 00:18:06,710
Is your Ji family that desperate
for money?

486
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:12,240
As far as I, Ji Ada, am concerned,

487
00:18:12,550 --> 00:18:14,490
it's a huge deal.

488
00:18:14,520 --> 00:18:16,530
Let alone a few bags of rice,

489
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:18,250
even if it's a single grain,

490
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:20,920
none of you will get

491
00:18:21,160 --> 00:18:23,050
to eat it without my permission.

492
00:18:24,640 --> 00:18:26,160
We've shown your Gong family some respect

493
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:27,380
in the past,

494
00:18:27,830 --> 00:18:30,160
but you just don't know
how to appreciate it.

495
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:32,550
The Gong flag only flies on the sea,

496
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:34,920
but once you come ashore,

497
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:37,420
the land

498
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:39,400
belongs to the Ji family.

499
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:40,640
This Ji Ada

500
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:43,490
really throws his weight around
just because

501
00:18:43,510 --> 00:18:45,030
he's related to the royal family.

502
00:18:45,030 --> 00:18:46,000
Do you few really think

503
00:18:46,000 --> 00:18:46,510
you're in a position

504
00:18:46,510 --> 00:18:47,910
to challenge our master?

505
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:49,240
Go get that Gong here

506
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:50,030
now!

507
00:18:50,030 --> 00:18:52,690
If you've got the guts,
wait till my men get here!

508
00:19:03,010 --> 00:19:04,790
[Brocade and Silks]

509
00:19:09,350 --> 00:19:10,480
Black Silk Leopard!

510
00:19:11,030 --> 00:19:11,920
Is this a dog?

511
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:12,680
It's a bear!

512
00:19:16,750 --> 00:19:18,750
They say it once bit through a man's neck,

513
00:19:18,750 --> 00:19:19,920
and that's how it got the nickname

514
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:20,980
"Throatbreaker."

515
00:19:21,440 --> 00:19:23,900
-Look at how vicious it is.
-Throatbreaker?

516
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:25,350
Our master said

517
00:19:25,750 --> 00:19:27,550
not to bother him over every little thing

518
00:19:27,550 --> 00:19:28,700
at the dock.

519
00:19:29,070 --> 00:19:30,310
Just bring Black Silk Leopard over

520
00:19:30,310 --> 00:19:31,110
to take a look.

521
00:19:36,980 --> 00:19:37,900
Just now,

522
00:19:38,070 --> 00:19:39,730
who was causing trouble here?

523
00:19:39,750 --> 00:19:40,550
Mr. Ji.

524
00:19:41,370 --> 00:19:42,770
Say something, will you?

525
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:45,350
Black Silk Leopard.

526
00:19:46,440 --> 00:19:47,640
What a fine dog.

527
00:19:48,190 --> 00:19:50,210
Go back and tell Gong Sihai

528
00:19:50,750 --> 00:19:52,880
I really like this Black Silk Leopard.

529
00:19:53,350 --> 00:19:54,750
Tell him to name his price.

530
00:19:54,750 --> 00:19:55,970
Whatever it costs,

531
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:57,180
I'll pay double.

532
00:19:57,210 --> 00:19:59,210
That's a deal you can't lose, right?

533
00:20:00,920 --> 00:20:02,920
Having a chance to do me a favor

534
00:20:03,310 --> 00:20:05,390
is a blessing for the Gong family.

535
00:20:05,420 --> 00:20:06,920
Ji Ada, what are you talking about?

536
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:08,680
Don't push it too far!

537
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:12,510
Move!

538
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:21,440
Guards!

539
00:20:27,490 --> 00:20:28,290
Master!

540
00:20:28,310 --> 00:20:29,550
Master, are you alright?

541
00:20:29,550 --> 00:20:30,950
-Let's go!
-Let's go now!

542
00:20:31,030 --> 00:20:32,070
Let's go now!

543
00:20:32,090 --> 00:20:32,900
Let's go!

544
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:39,510
Are you alright?

545
00:20:39,510 --> 00:20:39,920
I'm fine.

546
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:41,830
So it's the two Divine Constables.

547
00:20:41,830 --> 00:20:42,960
We meet again.

548
00:20:43,310 --> 00:20:45,550
If you hadn't intervened just now,

549
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:47,370
it would have been a disaster.

550
00:20:47,390 --> 00:20:49,310
So you knew it would cause trouble?

551
00:20:49,310 --> 00:20:50,680
Then why did you bring this beast out

552
00:20:50,680 --> 00:20:51,640
to show off?

553
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:53,960
Weren't you afraid it would hurt someone?

554
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:54,960
I absolutely

555
00:20:55,550 --> 00:20:57,510
cannot agree with you, My Lord.

556
00:20:57,830 --> 00:21:00,030
Although Black Silk Leopard is fierce,

557
00:21:00,160 --> 00:21:01,550
it is extremely smart

558
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:03,770
and would never bite people randomly.

559
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:05,830
As you saw just now,

560
00:21:05,850 --> 00:21:07,090
if Ji Ada hadn't

561
00:21:07,120 --> 00:21:08,680
provoked our Gong family first,

562
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:10,550
how could Black Silk Leopard, eager to

563
00:21:10,550 --> 00:21:12,350
protect its master,
have attacked on its own?

564
00:21:12,350 --> 00:21:13,310
Right, My Lord?

565
00:21:14,350 --> 00:21:15,400
So Black Silk Leopard

566
00:21:15,400 --> 00:21:16,720
is indeed a good dog.

567
00:21:17,160 --> 00:21:19,160
Does it just bite through the throat

568
00:21:19,160 --> 00:21:20,750
of whoever its master tells it to?

569
00:21:20,750 --> 00:21:21,550
My Lady,

570
00:21:21,680 --> 00:21:23,830
you can't joke about this.

571
00:21:23,980 --> 00:21:25,350
Throatbreaker?

572
00:21:25,350 --> 00:21:27,160
It's just a baseless rumor.

573
00:21:27,270 --> 00:21:28,480
It never happened.

574
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:31,960
Today, a corpse

575
00:21:31,980 --> 00:21:34,180
was found in the Yan River.

576
00:21:34,550 --> 00:21:35,550
Mr. Reda,

577
00:21:35,750 --> 00:21:37,070
please go back to your residence

578
00:21:37,070 --> 00:21:38,240
and tell Master Gong Sihai

579
00:21:38,240 --> 00:21:39,510
that the Divine Constable Bureau
invites him

580
00:21:39,510 --> 00:21:41,840
to the county office to identify the body.

581
00:21:49,130 --> 00:21:54,020
[Identifying the Bones,
Finding a Mother for an Orphaned Girl]

582
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:53,880
The green-haired demon?

583
00:22:54,200 --> 00:22:55,000
Meng Rui,

584
00:22:55,310 --> 00:22:56,110
watch out.

585
00:23:05,470 --> 00:23:06,370
Chiying bugs!

586
00:23:16,000 --> 00:23:17,190
It's a kid.

587
00:23:19,830 --> 00:23:20,840
Chiying bugs.

588
00:23:22,410 --> 00:23:23,170
Don't move!

589
00:23:24,030 --> 00:23:25,050
It seems

590
00:23:25,790 --> 00:23:27,590
it's exactly as Old Geezer said.

591
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:39,330
They are fireflies.

592
00:23:43,080 --> 00:23:44,030
You brat,

593
00:23:45,170 --> 00:23:46,690
you're quite smart.

594
00:23:46,720 --> 00:23:48,270
You know how to use fireflies for light

595
00:23:48,270 --> 00:23:49,510
when looking for things.

596
00:23:49,510 --> 00:23:50,310
I guess

597
00:23:51,510 --> 00:23:53,240
you're the green-haired demon

598
00:23:53,560 --> 00:23:55,560
they've been talking about, right?

599
00:23:59,750 --> 00:24:00,660
Why were you

600
00:24:01,240 --> 00:24:03,040
digging up those bones just now?

601
00:24:03,640 --> 00:24:04,720
What were you looking for?

602
00:24:04,720 --> 00:24:05,830
What's your name?

603
00:24:06,310 --> 00:24:07,120
Xia...

604
00:24:08,140 --> 00:24:11,460
[Xia Jiuying]

605
00:24:08,340 --> 00:24:09,240
Jiu...

606
00:24:11,400 --> 00:24:12,200
Ying!

607
00:24:20,720 --> 00:24:21,740
Fellow villagers,

608
00:24:21,740 --> 00:24:23,030
don't panic.

609
00:24:24,270 --> 00:24:25,240
Please step forward

610
00:24:25,090 --> 00:24:27,150
[Mingling County Government]

611
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:27,440
and identify the deceased's clothing.

612
00:24:27,720 --> 00:24:29,980
Anyone who recognizes this person

613
00:24:30,240 --> 00:24:31,880
or can provide any clues

614
00:24:32,510 --> 00:24:34,910
will be rewarded by the county government.

615
00:24:40,890 --> 00:24:44,600
[Gong Sihai, Owner of Gong's Shipping]

616
00:24:46,910 --> 00:24:49,890
[Mingling County Government]

617
00:24:50,480 --> 00:24:52,110
I'm Gong Sihai. I'm sorry

618
00:24:52,130 --> 00:24:53,970
for being late.

619
00:24:54,070 --> 00:24:55,350
This is the head of the Gong family,

620
00:24:55,350 --> 00:24:56,160
Gong Sihai,

621
00:24:56,270 --> 00:24:58,010
known as Fourth Master Gong.

622
00:24:58,400 --> 00:24:59,510
This is Lady Constable Frost,

623
00:24:59,510 --> 00:25:00,920
and this is Lord Constable Iron.

624
00:25:00,920 --> 00:25:02,270
Greetings, Lady Constable Frost,

625
00:25:02,270 --> 00:25:03,470
Lord Constable Iron.

626
00:25:06,310 --> 00:25:07,440
Fourth Master Gong.

627
00:25:08,110 --> 00:25:09,920
Please take a close look.

628
00:25:10,070 --> 00:25:11,720
Do you know this person?

629
00:25:24,310 --> 00:25:25,240
No.

630
00:25:28,510 --> 00:25:30,800
The corpse is mutilated
beyond recognition.

631
00:25:30,800 --> 00:25:31,930
Fourth Master Gong,

632
00:25:32,310 --> 00:25:34,640
how can you tell you don't recognize him?

633
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:36,880
It's exactly because I couldn't tell

634
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:38,720
that I said I don't recognize him.

635
00:25:38,720 --> 00:25:40,030
If it is someone familiar,

636
00:25:40,030 --> 00:25:40,960
even if mutilated beyond recognition,

637
00:25:40,960 --> 00:25:42,690
you will still recognize them.

638
00:25:43,200 --> 00:25:44,440
Lady Constable Frost,

639
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:46,040
you are implying something.

640
00:25:47,720 --> 00:25:49,590
If I'm guessing correctly,

641
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:50,440
this person

642
00:25:50,590 --> 00:25:52,200
was bitten to death, right?

643
00:25:52,220 --> 00:25:53,280
When Reda came back

644
00:25:53,480 --> 00:25:54,880
from the dock today

645
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:56,400
and told me you two

646
00:25:56,880 --> 00:25:58,310
had invited me to identify a body,

647
00:25:58,310 --> 00:25:59,310
I figured

648
00:25:59,480 --> 00:26:00,720
that because of

649
00:26:01,030 --> 00:26:02,960
Black Silk Leopard's appearance,

650
00:26:03,240 --> 00:26:04,640
you two had probably already considered me

651
00:26:04,640 --> 00:26:06,000
a suspect.

652
00:26:06,070 --> 00:26:08,680
It's about a human life.
How can we afford to overlook anything?

653
00:26:08,680 --> 00:26:10,310
The case hasn't been solved yet.

654
00:26:10,310 --> 00:26:11,830
Until we catch the real killer,

655
00:26:11,830 --> 00:26:13,310
anyone could be a suspect.

656
00:26:13,310 --> 00:26:14,510
Then let me say a word

657
00:26:14,510 --> 00:26:15,510
in my own defense.

658
00:26:15,830 --> 00:26:16,880
I keep Black Silk Leopard

659
00:26:16,880 --> 00:26:18,880
as a guard dog.

660
00:26:18,880 --> 00:26:21,080
I rarely even take it out of the mansion.

661
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:23,310
And I would never

662
00:26:23,310 --> 00:26:24,440
let it hurt anyone.

663
00:26:25,790 --> 00:26:27,440
As for what happened at the dock today,

664
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:29,030
as you could see,

665
00:26:29,440 --> 00:26:31,110
it was purely an accident.

666
00:26:35,830 --> 00:26:37,590
Fourth Master Gong, don't get worked up.

667
00:26:37,590 --> 00:26:39,110
We never said it was you.

668
00:26:39,720 --> 00:26:40,440
Since you don't recognize him,

669
00:26:40,440 --> 00:26:41,970
then there's nothing else.

670
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:43,270
You may leave.

671
00:26:45,790 --> 00:26:47,110
Then I will take my leave.

672
00:26:47,110 --> 00:26:47,920
Please.

673
00:26:51,240 --> 00:26:52,480
People from Tianhuang City are here.

674
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:53,400
Things are unsettled right now.

675
00:26:53,400 --> 00:26:54,880
Find the Young Master
and bring him back at once.

676
00:26:54,880 --> 00:26:55,640
Yes.

677
00:26:58,010 --> 00:27:03,570
[Mingling County Government]

678
00:27:03,110 --> 00:27:04,000
Lord Situ,

679
00:27:04,000 --> 00:27:05,400
please have the body taken to the morgue

680
00:27:05,400 --> 00:27:06,110
and kept under guard.

681
00:27:06,110 --> 00:27:07,480
I need to continue the autopsy.

682
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:08,310
Alright.

683
00:27:08,680 --> 00:27:09,440
Lai.

684
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:10,110
Yes.

685
00:27:10,350 --> 00:27:11,160
Lift it.

686
00:27:10,910 --> 00:27:13,930
[Mingling County Government]

687
00:27:15,710 --> 00:27:16,590
Everyone, disperse.

688
00:27:16,590 --> 00:27:17,790
Stop gathering here.

689
00:27:22,830 --> 00:27:24,070
You noticed him too?

690
00:27:24,210 --> 00:27:25,880
He stood at the very back of the crowd,

691
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:27,680
but he couldn't stop looking in.

692
00:27:27,680 --> 00:27:29,270
Even when he left, his pace

693
00:27:29,270 --> 00:27:31,130
was faster than everyone else's.

694
00:27:31,480 --> 00:27:33,110
He must know the deceased.

695
00:27:33,720 --> 00:27:34,480
Did you notice

696
00:27:34,480 --> 00:27:36,110
his ears just now?

697
00:27:36,790 --> 00:27:37,590
Cauliflower ears?

698
00:27:37,590 --> 00:27:38,310
Exactly.

699
00:27:38,310 --> 00:27:39,640
They are exactly the same as those
of the corpse from the Yan River.

700
00:27:39,640 --> 00:27:41,310
I'm very familiar with ears like these.

701
00:27:41,310 --> 00:27:41,920
You don't get ears like these

702
00:27:41,920 --> 00:27:43,790
unless you've trained in wrestling

703
00:27:43,790 --> 00:27:45,640
for 10 or 20 years.

704
00:27:46,400 --> 00:27:47,320
So,

705
00:27:47,400 --> 00:27:48,720
the victim must have been skilled

706
00:27:48,720 --> 00:27:49,830
in wrestling too.

707
00:27:49,720 --> 00:27:52,950
[Mingling County Government]

708
00:27:50,480 --> 00:27:51,510
There must be some connection

709
00:27:51,510 --> 00:27:52,880
between the two of them.

710
00:27:53,830 --> 00:27:54,640
Try this.

711
00:27:57,310 --> 00:27:58,110
Eat up.

712
00:27:58,170 --> 00:27:59,070
Don't pick up dirty things

713
00:27:59,070 --> 00:28:00,800
from the ground to eat anymore.

714
00:28:03,640 --> 00:28:04,440
Xia Jiuying.

715
00:28:04,480 --> 00:28:05,310
I was asking

716
00:28:05,340 --> 00:28:06,660
where you live.

717
00:28:06,830 --> 00:28:07,880
But you brought me

718
00:28:07,880 --> 00:28:09,270
to Ji's Rice Shop.

719
00:28:09,310 --> 00:28:10,770
Are you from the Ji family?

720
00:28:12,920 --> 00:28:13,980
Then let me ask you.

721
00:28:14,640 --> 00:28:16,240
Does the Ji family keep dogs?

722
00:28:22,110 --> 00:28:23,640
Do they or not?

723
00:28:29,510 --> 00:28:30,530
This child.

724
00:28:30,680 --> 00:28:31,740
I've asked around.

725
00:28:32,470 --> 00:28:33,440
The people around here

726
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:34,590
all know this child.

727
00:28:34,590 --> 00:28:35,960
They say she's a servant of the Ji family.

728
00:28:35,960 --> 00:28:37,240
She is a girl.

729
00:28:37,720 --> 00:28:39,120
With her hair a mess,

730
00:28:39,400 --> 00:28:41,400
the way she's wolfing down her food,

731
00:28:41,400 --> 00:28:42,860
and her tattered clothes,

732
00:28:44,030 --> 00:28:45,270
it's obvious she's been poorly treated

733
00:28:45,270 --> 00:28:46,720
at Ji Mansion.

734
00:28:50,590 --> 00:28:51,400
Meng Rui.

735
00:28:53,230 --> 00:28:55,030
Look at the scar on her neck.

736
00:28:55,420 --> 00:28:57,110
Doesn't it look like it was caused

737
00:28:57,110 --> 00:28:57,920
by a dog chain?

738
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:00,030
I'm full.

739
00:29:00,060 --> 00:29:00,500
I'm leaving.

740
00:29:00,500 --> 00:29:01,230
Xia Jiuying!

741
00:29:03,060 --> 00:29:03,950
Stand still.

742
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:05,480
Listen to me.

743
00:29:05,560 --> 00:29:07,770
Although you are a servant of Ji Mansion,

744
00:29:07,770 --> 00:29:08,940
if in the future

745
00:29:09,480 --> 00:29:10,750
Ji Ada treats you badly,

746
00:29:10,750 --> 00:29:11,550
or

747
00:29:11,780 --> 00:29:12,980
if he dares to hit you,

748
00:29:14,070 --> 00:29:15,470
you don't have to go back.

749
00:29:16,830 --> 00:29:17,640
No!

750
00:29:18,510 --> 00:29:19,590
I want to go back!

751
00:29:25,680 --> 00:29:26,770
This child.

752
00:29:27,150 --> 00:29:28,340
[Rice Shop]

753
00:29:30,270 --> 00:29:31,310
You've been watching

754
00:29:31,310 --> 00:29:33,070
this rice shop since earlier.

755
00:29:33,240 --> 00:29:34,440
Any clues?

756
00:29:35,270 --> 00:29:36,480
Since we got here,

757
00:29:36,920 --> 00:29:38,070
a total of 27 people

758
00:29:38,070 --> 00:29:39,590
have gone into the rice shop,

759
00:29:39,590 --> 00:29:40,790
but only five or six

760
00:29:41,070 --> 00:29:42,400
have come out.

761
00:29:42,100 --> 00:29:43,920
[Rice Shop]

762
00:29:42,720 --> 00:29:44,190
Whether they bought rice or not,

763
00:29:44,190 --> 00:29:45,590
[Rice Shop]

764
00:29:44,510 --> 00:29:45,710
they have to come out.

765
00:29:46,400 --> 00:29:48,110
Where did the remaining

766
00:29:49,010 --> 00:29:50,050
20 or so people go?

767
00:29:50,240 --> 00:29:52,340
They couldn't have just vanished
into thin air.

768
00:29:52,340 --> 00:29:53,360
So,

769
00:29:54,640 --> 00:29:55,880
in this rice shop,

770
00:29:56,310 --> 00:29:58,000
there must be a hidden secret.

771
00:29:58,790 --> 00:30:00,110
Then let's go and see

772
00:30:00,440 --> 00:30:01,480
the quality

773
00:30:01,480 --> 00:30:02,810
of the Ji family's rice.

774
00:30:04,110 --> 00:30:06,070
Before we go, we...

775
00:30:07,880 --> 00:30:09,310
need to dress up.

776
00:30:09,880 --> 00:30:12,080
Gold rice, silver rice, and pearl rice.

777
00:30:12,240 --> 00:30:14,640
They say in the Ji family's rice bags,

778
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:16,100
there are rare treasures.

779
00:30:16,110 --> 00:30:16,920
Today,

780
00:30:17,830 --> 00:30:18,880
I'd like to

781
00:30:19,110 --> 00:30:20,880
broaden my horizons here.

782
00:30:21,480 --> 00:30:22,310
Rui,

783
00:30:22,880 --> 00:30:24,480
go get the manager.

784
00:30:24,640 --> 00:30:25,790
I...

785
00:30:26,000 --> 00:30:28,260
am going to
spend a lot of money here today

786
00:30:29,070 --> 00:30:30,730
and play for some real stakes.

787
00:30:31,110 --> 00:30:31,920
Manager.

788
00:30:33,310 --> 00:30:34,110
Coming!

789
00:30:35,680 --> 00:30:36,640
Gentlemen,

790
00:30:36,720 --> 00:30:38,110
what would you like to buy?

791
00:30:38,110 --> 00:30:39,240
That depends on

792
00:30:40,030 --> 00:30:41,790
what you sell here.

793
00:30:41,650 --> 00:30:46,610
[Grain]

794
00:30:42,590 --> 00:30:43,880
You must be joking.

795
00:30:43,880 --> 00:30:45,110
This is a rice shop,

796
00:30:45,110 --> 00:30:47,110
so naturally we sell rice and grain.

797
00:30:47,590 --> 00:30:48,590
Rice sounds fine.

798
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:50,310
There is an ancient saying
about a golden millet dream.

799
00:30:50,310 --> 00:30:51,110
Today,

800
00:30:51,880 --> 00:30:52,880
I want to

801
00:30:52,880 --> 00:30:54,940
live it up and forget myself for once.

802
00:30:57,440 --> 00:30:58,590
I want to buy that.

803
00:31:00,070 --> 00:31:02,270
What are you talking about?

804
00:31:03,510 --> 00:31:04,790
That.

805
00:31:13,480 --> 00:31:14,740
To be honest, Manager,

806
00:31:14,880 --> 00:31:15,880
Rui and I

807
00:31:15,880 --> 00:31:18,270
came here especially

808
00:31:18,500 --> 00:31:20,100
because of your reputation.

809
00:31:22,750 --> 00:31:24,270
Oh, that?

810
00:31:24,480 --> 00:31:25,270
Sir,

811
00:31:25,310 --> 00:31:27,380
you've come to the right place.

812
00:31:28,070 --> 00:31:29,070
Please follow me.

813
00:31:30,030 --> 00:31:30,830
Please.

814
00:31:31,310 --> 00:31:33,000
Let's go, Rui.

815
00:31:34,510 --> 00:31:35,110
Please.

816
00:31:35,110 --> 00:31:35,680
We clearly saw him

817
00:31:35,680 --> 00:31:36,880
come this way.

818
00:31:38,310 --> 00:31:39,680
Yan, Miss Bai?

819
00:31:40,680 --> 00:31:42,830
Are you two here to spend

820
00:31:42,880 --> 00:31:44,080
some money today too?

821
00:31:46,560 --> 00:31:47,900
[Grain]

822
00:31:50,880 --> 00:31:51,590
We heard

823
00:31:51,590 --> 00:31:52,830
you were here,

824
00:31:52,850 --> 00:31:53,610
so we thought

825
00:31:53,640 --> 00:31:54,680
we'd come and join the fun.

826
00:31:54,680 --> 00:31:55,510
Right, right.

827
00:31:55,530 --> 00:31:57,190
I'm just following my sister.

828
00:31:57,510 --> 00:31:58,830
You came at the right time.

829
00:31:58,830 --> 00:31:59,640
Today,

830
00:31:59,920 --> 00:32:01,310
all expenses

831
00:32:01,510 --> 00:32:03,030
are on me.

832
00:32:06,910 --> 00:32:07,710
Everyone,

833
00:32:08,070 --> 00:32:09,200
please come inside.

834
00:32:15,040 --> 00:32:16,080
I didn't expect

835
00:32:16,110 --> 00:32:17,240
there to be a whole other world

836
00:32:17,240 --> 00:32:18,500
behind this rice shop.

837
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:21,510
It finally feels like

838
00:32:21,510 --> 00:32:23,200
a major case.

839
00:32:23,200 --> 00:32:25,310
Come on, place your bets! One hundred!

840
00:32:25,310 --> 00:32:26,640
Bets are final!

841
00:32:38,400 --> 00:32:39,200
Looks like

842
00:32:39,950 --> 00:32:41,950
this is an underground boxing ring.

843
00:32:42,070 --> 00:32:44,270
Let's split up and see

844
00:32:44,510 --> 00:32:46,910
if there are any other illegal activities.

845
00:33:05,110 --> 00:33:06,240
Hit him!

846
00:33:11,110 --> 00:33:11,880
Come on!

847
00:33:14,880 --> 00:33:17,030
-Bravo!
-Hit him!

848
00:33:17,030 --> 00:33:18,270
Hurry! Hurry!

849
00:33:18,270 --> 00:33:19,070
That's the guy

850
00:33:19,070 --> 00:33:20,070
Zhenzhu and I followed

851
00:33:20,070 --> 00:33:21,000
from the county office.

852
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:23,480
Looks like the victim
in the Yan River corpse case

853
00:33:23,480 --> 00:33:25,880
used to fight underground boxing here too.

854
00:33:48,400 --> 00:33:49,270
Harder!

855
00:33:49,270 --> 00:33:50,550
Go!

856
00:33:54,880 --> 00:33:56,100
I want my mother!

857
00:33:56,240 --> 00:33:58,370
-I want my mother!
-Jiuying! Jiuying.

858
00:33:58,640 --> 00:33:59,880
It's me, Gong Le.

859
00:34:02,240 --> 00:34:04,870
[Gong Le, Young Master of the Gong Family]

860
00:34:04,890 --> 00:34:05,760
Who is it?

861
00:34:06,090 --> 00:34:07,650
Who's teasing the dog here?

862
00:34:08,719 --> 00:34:10,000
Huang Mazi is coming!

863
00:34:11,400 --> 00:34:13,219
Who is it? Who's back there?

864
00:34:25,090 --> 00:34:26,040
Come on, Jiuying.

865
00:34:26,040 --> 00:34:27,920
-I'm not going!
-Come on.

866
00:34:29,480 --> 00:34:30,280
Be a good girl.

867
00:34:35,150 --> 00:34:35,960
Let's go.

868
00:34:37,880 --> 00:34:38,670
Let's go.

869
00:34:44,070 --> 00:34:44,880
Beat him!

870
00:34:44,880 --> 00:34:45,780
Go!

871
00:34:50,840 --> 00:34:52,130
Not eating?

872
00:34:52,670 --> 00:34:53,590
You're too spoiled.

873
00:34:53,590 --> 00:34:54,230
Master!

874
00:34:54,710 --> 00:34:55,510
Master!

875
00:34:55,880 --> 00:34:56,590
Come on!

876
00:34:57,230 --> 00:34:59,360
This... This girl came back on her own?

877
00:35:01,070 --> 00:35:02,440
Don't bother me here.

878
00:35:03,480 --> 00:35:04,230
Drag her away.

879
00:35:04,230 --> 00:35:06,690
Give her a whipping
and starve her for 3 days.

880
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:08,220
If she runs away again,

881
00:35:08,400 --> 00:35:09,600
break one of her legs.

882
00:35:10,880 --> 00:35:12,140
I dare you to run again!

883
00:35:15,800 --> 00:35:16,590
Master.

884
00:35:17,630 --> 00:35:19,300
Are you still worrying about

885
00:35:19,330 --> 00:35:21,300
Black Silk Leopard?

886
00:35:21,440 --> 00:35:23,380
I've been having bad luck lately.

887
00:35:23,440 --> 00:35:24,760
Bad things

888
00:35:26,880 --> 00:35:28,960
keep happening one after another.

889
00:35:37,800 --> 00:35:40,150
-Bravo!
-We won!

890
00:35:56,670 --> 00:35:57,630
We won!

891
00:36:00,030 --> 00:36:01,050
One more round!

892
00:36:03,150 --> 00:36:03,890
How is it?

893
00:36:08,030 --> 00:36:08,920
You piece of trash!

894
00:36:08,920 --> 00:36:09,960
Look at you!

895
00:36:09,960 --> 00:36:11,220
You made me lose money!

896
00:36:28,710 --> 00:36:29,510
Rice paste?

897
00:36:29,880 --> 00:36:31,070
Cloth strips dipped in rice paste

898
00:36:31,070 --> 00:36:31,880
become extremely hard

899
00:36:31,880 --> 00:36:33,150
once they dry.

900
00:36:33,590 --> 00:36:35,960
Wrapping them around your hands
protects them

901
00:36:35,960 --> 00:36:38,360
and makes your punches much more powerful.

902
00:36:39,070 --> 00:36:40,190
I see.

903
00:36:40,230 --> 00:36:41,150
Alright, he won!

904
00:36:41,150 --> 00:36:42,850
Will you keep your promise?

905
00:36:42,880 --> 00:36:43,670
Zhe Shan!

906
00:36:43,670 --> 00:36:45,130
Call Zhe Shan out to fight!

907
00:36:45,510 --> 00:36:46,510
Where is Zhe Shan?

908
00:36:46,880 --> 00:36:47,960
Have you found him?

909
00:36:48,880 --> 00:36:50,030
Not yet.

910
00:36:50,190 --> 00:36:51,000
Master.

911
00:36:51,080 --> 00:36:52,680
Right now, among our boxers,

912
00:36:52,840 --> 00:36:53,880
besides Zhe Shan,

913
00:36:53,960 --> 00:36:55,220
only Tiesha is decent.

914
00:36:55,230 --> 00:36:56,090
As for the rest,

915
00:36:56,230 --> 00:36:58,440
there are really few who can really fight.

916
00:36:58,440 --> 00:36:59,490
The matches in the arena

917
00:36:59,490 --> 00:37:01,280
are getting less and less interesting.

918
00:37:01,280 --> 00:37:02,230
In the future,

919
00:37:02,400 --> 00:37:04,480
I'm afraid fewer people will place bets.

920
00:37:04,480 --> 00:37:06,190
Gamblers may love to gamble,

921
00:37:06,360 --> 00:37:07,690
but they're not stupid.

922
00:37:08,590 --> 00:37:10,280
If there are no new tricks,

923
00:37:10,760 --> 00:37:11,640
taking all

924
00:37:11,670 --> 00:37:13,280
their money

925
00:37:13,280 --> 00:37:14,670
won't be that simple.

926
00:37:15,230 --> 00:37:16,030
Where is Zhe Shan?

927
00:37:16,030 --> 00:37:16,880
Bro,

928
00:37:16,960 --> 00:37:18,670
who is this Zhe Shan you're talking about?

929
00:37:18,670 --> 00:37:19,880
You don't even know him?

930
00:37:19,880 --> 00:37:21,670
He is the Ji family's top boxer.

931
00:37:21,670 --> 00:37:22,760
He is ruthless,

932
00:37:22,760 --> 00:37:24,220
winning 9 out of 10 fights.

933
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:25,110
This Zhe Shan

934
00:37:25,130 --> 00:37:26,400
hasn't come out for a long time, right?

935
00:37:26,400 --> 00:37:27,360
Exactly.

936
00:37:27,360 --> 00:37:28,070
He made me

937
00:37:28,070 --> 00:37:30,130
lose money for half a month straight.

938
00:37:30,630 --> 00:37:31,590
Tell Zhe Shan to come out!

939
00:37:31,590 --> 00:37:32,340
Zhe Shan!

940
00:37:32,920 --> 00:37:33,590
Come out!

941
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:34,880
In my opinion,

942
00:37:34,880 --> 00:37:36,880
that corpse is most likely Zhe Shan.

943
00:37:37,630 --> 00:37:38,440
Do you think

944
00:37:38,480 --> 00:37:39,630
it's possible

945
00:37:40,000 --> 00:37:41,320
that Zhe Shan was bitten to death

946
00:37:41,320 --> 00:37:42,580
by the Ji family's dog?

947
00:37:44,190 --> 00:37:45,720
The Ji family keeps dogs,

948
00:37:45,840 --> 00:37:47,000
but they wouldn't let them hurt people,

949
00:37:47,000 --> 00:37:47,840
let alone kill

950
00:37:47,840 --> 00:37:49,070
their own boxer.

951
00:37:49,280 --> 00:37:50,400
I don't think so.

952
00:38:00,590 --> 00:38:02,670
How come I forgot you?

953
00:38:03,110 --> 00:38:04,010
Shui!

954
00:38:04,360 --> 00:38:05,960
Send Xia Jiuying to the ring!

955
00:38:07,920 --> 00:38:08,710
Master,

956
00:38:08,960 --> 00:38:10,250
can this girl do it?

957
00:38:10,920 --> 00:38:12,110
Don't forget,

958
00:38:12,110 --> 00:38:13,320
she fought wild dogs for food

959
00:38:13,320 --> 00:38:14,920
at the age of seven,

960
00:38:15,190 --> 00:38:16,360
and at nine, she could kill

961
00:38:16,360 --> 00:38:17,800
an alpha wolf.

962
00:38:18,190 --> 00:38:19,760
Winning or losing doesn't matter.

963
00:38:19,760 --> 00:38:21,010
What matters is...

964
00:38:21,960 --> 00:38:24,360
putting on a good show
for the people down there.

965
00:38:24,360 --> 00:38:25,340
Otherwise,

966
00:38:26,150 --> 00:38:27,450
they'll think

967
00:38:27,590 --> 00:38:30,110
there's no one left in the Ji family.

968
00:38:32,750 --> 00:38:33,590
Yes.

969
00:38:35,320 --> 00:38:36,110
Come on.

970
00:38:36,760 --> 00:38:37,590
Go!

971
00:38:45,760 --> 00:38:46,590
Go!

972
00:39:03,400 --> 00:39:04,560
Xia Jiuying?

973
00:39:05,030 --> 00:39:05,840
Who?

974
00:39:06,440 --> 00:39:07,150
Meng Rui and I met her

975
00:39:07,150 --> 00:39:08,760
in the Corpse Forest Graveyard.

976
00:39:08,760 --> 00:39:10,760
The green-haired demon Situ Bo mentioned

977
00:39:10,760 --> 00:39:11,800
must be her.

978
00:39:15,400 --> 00:39:16,760
Let's go take a look.

979
00:39:19,190 --> 00:39:20,000
Who is she?

980
00:39:22,910 --> 00:39:24,260
I'm asking you!

981
00:39:24,400 --> 00:39:25,590
Are you kidding me?

982
00:39:25,670 --> 00:39:27,530
Having this little brat fight me?

983
00:39:31,100 --> 00:39:32,360
Teach her a good lesson!

984
00:39:32,360 --> 00:39:33,000
Will you fight or not?

985
00:39:33,000 --> 00:39:33,680
Yeah!

986
00:39:36,190 --> 00:39:37,040
Fight!

987
00:39:38,710 --> 00:39:40,070
Beat her to death!

988
00:39:47,220 --> 00:39:48,510
[Small]

989
00:39:47,920 --> 00:39:49,590
Come on, place your bets!

990
00:39:48,530 --> 00:39:49,820
[Xia Jiuying]

991
00:39:49,590 --> 00:39:51,760
Xia Jiuying or Tiesha?

992
00:39:52,480 --> 00:39:54,360
Bets are final! Bets are final!

993
00:39:54,400 --> 00:39:56,190
Come on, hurry up!

994
00:39:56,360 --> 00:39:57,670
Bets are final!

995
00:39:57,830 --> 00:39:59,250
[Xia Jiuying]

996
00:39:58,280 --> 00:39:58,800
Tiesha!

997
00:40:01,440 --> 00:40:02,070
Bet on Tiesha!

998
00:40:02,070 --> 00:40:03,540
Hurry up and pay!

999
00:40:03,710 --> 00:40:04,830
Wolf cub,

1000
00:40:05,760 --> 00:40:06,800
whether I can

1001
00:40:06,800 --> 00:40:08,260
win big this time

1002
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:10,070
depends on you.
